{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_01_the_shape_reduce", "label": "reduce callback and initial value", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/05-reduce/01-the-shape.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "callback(accumulator, currentValue, currentIndex, array). Second parameter of reduce is initialValue, so there is no thisArg."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_01_the_shape_reduce_no_initial", "label": "reduce without initialValue", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/05-reduce/01-the-shape.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "First element becomes the accumulator; iteration starts at index 1; empty array throws TypeError; single element returns it with no callback call."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_01_the_shape_always_pass_initial", "label": "Always pass a reduce initial value", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/05-reduce/01-the-shape.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An empty array is the first render, a filtered-to-nothing list, an API with no rows. Initial value also declares the accumulator type."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_01_the_shape_reduce_holes_vs_undefined", "label": "reduce skips holes not undefined", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/05-reduce/01-the-shape.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "[1,2,,4] sums to 7; [1,2,undefined,4] is NaN. Clearest demonstration that a hole is not undefined."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_01_the_shape_reduce_missing_return", "label": "Missing return in reduce callback", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/05-reduce/01-the-shape.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Most common reduce bug. Next accumulator is undefined; failure appears on the second iteration."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_01_the_shape_reduceright", "label": "reduceRight", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/05-reduce/01-the-shape.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Same method from the end. Matters only when the operation is not associative (compose, string building)."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_01_the_shape_reduce_for_of_equivalent", "label": "reduce is a for...of loop", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/05-reduce/01-the-shape.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "MDN equivalence: any reduce you cannot immediately rewrite as that loop should have been the loop."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_01_the_shape_page", "label": "05.1 \u00b7 The shape that stays readable", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/05-reduce/01-the-shape.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_01_the_shape_page", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_01_the_shape_reduce", "relatio